fail a completed write') so an advisory read failure never aborts the mutation, and state this in Approach.","cohort":["T8"],"criteria":["T8"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.264,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'each handler calls cross_session_warning_for first (reading the live holder), then performs rebar.<op>(...)'","cross_session_warning_for does real reads (show_ticket, load_config) that can raise: src/rebar/_commands/cross_session.py:33-43","The parallel advisory _push_status explicitly guards this: 'a status read must never fail a completed write' (src/rebar/_mcp_writes.py:56) — no equivalent guard is specified for the pre-mutation warning read"],"finding":"The plan does not specify a fallback when the advisory sub-step cross_session_warning_for raises. Because the plan mandates computing the warning BEFORE the mutation, and the detector performs live I/O (show_ticket, load_config, resolve_session_id per src/rebar/_commands/cross_session.py:33-43), an exception in this advisory-only read would abort a mutation that would otherwise succeed.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f72d98d9c697552d8","impact":0.536,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach — 'Compute the warning BEFORE the underlying mutation runs.'","norm_id":"nb39cd130066ed29f","priority":0.536,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The live holder read (show_ticket) or config load raises transiently while a client calls comment_ticket/transition_ticket; the write is aborted even though the advisory is non-essential."],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"Wrap the pre-mutation cross_session_warning_for call in a try/except that maps any exception to None, matching the _push_status guarantee, and document that the warning is best-effort advisory.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"medium","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Resolve `compact_ticket` (a single-ticket-capable `_ack` write at src/rebar/_mcp_writes.py:441/445): either add it to the populated-handler list or add it to the explicit-exclusion list with a stated rationale.","cohort":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"criteria":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.4187,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan enumeration list of single-ticket `_ack` write handlers does not name compact_ticket, and the exclusion paragraph only excludes claim_ticket, check_ac, quality_check, declare_no_file_impact.","src/rebar/_mcp_writes.py:441 `def compact_ticket(ticket_id: str | None = None) -> WriteAckOut:` ... :445 `return _ack()`"],"finding":"The plan enumerates the single-ticket `_ack`-based write handlers that populate the new `cross_session_warning` field, but omits `compact_ticket` (src/rebar/_mcp_writes.py:441, ack at :445) — a `_ack`-based write whose signature `compact_ticket(ticket_id: str | None = None)` makes it single-ticket-capable when an id is passed. Unlike `claim_ticket` and the deferred trio, `compact_ticket` is neither listed as populated nor explicitly excluded, so its status is unresolved in the affected-handler inventory.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f6b230b02c2e5dd01","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach — 'The single-ticket MCP tools whose response model carries the field via `_ack` / `TicketStateOut` are: ... comment_ticket, edit_ticket, tag_ticket, untag_ticket, set_file_impact, set_verify_commands, archive_ticket, link_tickets ... unlink_tickets'","norm_id":"n5067a02a19b73947","priority":0.4813,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["src/rebar/_mcp_writes.py:441 compact_ticket builds its response through `_ack` (line 445) and accepts a single ticket_id; if not addressed, a single-ticket compact against a cross-session-held ticket silently omits the advisory the feature intends, and a reviewer cannot tell whether the omission was deliberate."],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.875,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"insufficient","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"incomplete_enumeration","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Cite the prerequisite detector story explicitly (e.g. `cross_session_warning_for [rebar:<C>]`) and record the depends_on edge so the executor knows it must land first.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["E6","E2"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.8,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'Populate it from cross_session_warning_for(ticket_id, ...)' — the callee is created by a separate story","'Depends on the detector ... and the reducer clearing' names the dependency but gives no ticket id / edge citation"],"finding":"The plan declares a hard dependency on the sibling detector symbol `cross_session_warning_for` (and the reducer clearing) in prose but does not establish/cite the dependency edge in the rebar `[rebar:<C>]` form, so the executor cannot confirm the prerequisite has landed before the contract tests (which invoke handlers that call `cross_session_warning_for`) can pass.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fb3c1ba8ebb67f5b6","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context / Problem: 'Depends on the detector (cross_session_warning_for, sibling story) and the reducer clearing.'","norm_id":"ne90888ffe65e1b9d","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Executor picks up this story before the detector story merges; `cross_session_warning_for` is undefined and every contract test errors at import/call time."],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact